{"id":"cartridges-anatomy","rev":1,"lang":"pl","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Budowa naboju","summary":"Hull (łuska), primer (spłonka), powder (proch), wad (przybitka), śrut i zawijka: co jest wewnątrz sportowego naboju, jak każda część wpływa na strzał i jakie cartridge (naboje) zakazują przepisy Sporting™ i Compak® Sporting.","body":[{"k":"gear-cartridges-p1","t":"p","html":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pl/glossary/cartridge/\"><span lang=\"en\">Cartridge</span> (nabój)</a> zawiera wszystko na jeden strzał: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pl/glossary/hull/\"><span lang=\"en\">hull</span> (łuskę)</a> z metalowym denkiem, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pl/glossary/primer/\"><span lang=\"en\">primer</span> (spłonkę)</a>, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pl/glossary/powder/\"><span lang=\"en\">powder</span> (proch)</a>, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pl/glossary/wad/\"><span lang=\"en\">wad</span> (przybitkę)</a> i śrut. Strzelcy mówią też „shell”. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pl/glossary/empties/\"><span lang=\"en\">Empty cases</span> (puste łuski)</a> to wystrzelone łuski.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null,"anchor":"gear-cartridges"},{"k":"dg-cartridge-cutaway","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\">Nabój w przekroju</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"40 70 520 250\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\" focusable=\"false\"><rect class=\"dg-c1\" x=\"96\" y=\"96\" width=\"440\" height=\"138\" rx=\"3\"/><rect class=\"dg-cut\" x=\"104\" y=\"104\" width=\"424\" height=\"122\"/>\n<path class=\"dg-c2\" d=\"M58 86h20v6h80v146h-80v6h-20z\"/><rect class=\"dg-c3\" x=\"58\" y=\"148\" width=\"26\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\"/>\n<rect class=